  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A square wave of the modulating signal is shown in the figure. The carrier wave is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>Volt. The modulation index is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f3bd4be5-7de9-472e-a6dc-fed14115bfeb-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 137px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
